What is code, what is content
-----------------------------

Code (MIT):
  * public/index.html — the HTML structure, embedded CSS, and embedded
    JavaScript that drives the page (interaction logic, animation
    code, layout system).

Content (CC BY 4.0):
  * README.md
  * public/llms.txt
  * The visible textual copy embedded in public/index.html (headlines,
    telemetry tile labels and bodies, brand tag, kicker, button
    labels, footer attribution).
  * public/images/kv-hero-001.jpg
  * public/images/kv-hero-002.jpg
  * public/images/kv-hero-003.jpg
  * public/images/kv-hero-004.jpg

Names and logos (NOT licensed):
  * The "kVadrum" name.
  * public/images/kV.png — the kV monogram, current optimized 512px asset.
  * source/kV-original.png — the lossless 1520px source for the same
    monogram.


